concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-70-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-70-ss-1-logic-deontic-4 .
